# coach-watchface flow
# No live-write hazards: the watchface only GETs /api/today (read-only).
# Installing a watchface on emery makes it the active face directly (no launcher
# navigation needed on this emulator). If a wipe ever drops you at the launcher,
# select Watchfaces and pick "Coach" per HANDOFF.
app coach-watchface
wait 8
shot coach-face                # live glance face: time, protein/cal bars, session chip, 7d weight
